OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fisolated showers likely through the
OL,7,Fevening, but these fading to be mainly
OL,8,Fdry by midnight. Winds also easing to
OL,9,Fbecome light and variable into the
OL,10,Fearly hours. The odd patch of mist is
OL,11,Fpossible by dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FChilly start. Staying fine and
OL,14,Fdry, with light winds and some patchy
OL,15,Ffair weather cloud developing.
OL,16,FBecoming cloudier overnight, with a
OL,17,Fstrengthening breeze. Temperatures
OL,18,Fnear normal for October.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
